{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSRange","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"range","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCoordinates:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"coords","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger","text":"NSUInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"range","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The range of vertices to replace. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"location","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field indicates","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices to replace."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"coords","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"this array is copied to the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}]},{"name":"count","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coords"},{"type":"text","text":" array to insert in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place of the coordinates in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":". The sum of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":"’s length and this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count must not exceed the number of items currently in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape"},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" is greater than the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effectively be inserted into the shape. On the other hand, if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" is less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will effectively be removed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRangeException"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-appendCoordinates:count:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:","abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"title":"MLNMultiPoint","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composed of multiple vertices."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","title":"MLNShapeSource","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape